<title>FINLAND: RAUTARUUKKI'S RANNILA SETS CZECH J/V.</title>
<headline>RAUTARUUKKI'S RANNILA SETS CZECH J/V.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish steel group Rautaruukki Oy said in a statement on Monday its Rannila Steel unit had established a joint venture in the Czech Repuplic for production of roof and wall steel profiles.</p>
<p>&quot;Rannila Velvary is a joint venture, of which Rannila Steel holds 65 percent and Czech Comax s.r.o. 35 percent,&quot; Rautaruukki said.</p>
</text>
